<item>
            <title>[KYLIN-5763] Very slow to filter query history</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KYLIN-5763</link>
                <project id="12316121" key="KYLIN">Kylin</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;If there are many queryHistory records,&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;1) filtering them by query object is very slow;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;2) searching them by key(the model name) cannot work.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&#160;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;However, executing query in mysql, the result responses very fast.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;code panel&quot; style=&quot;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;codeContent panelContent&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;code-sql&quot;&gt;
