                            <comment id="17832341" author="JIRAUSER294653" created="Sat, 30 Mar 2024 01:30:27 +0000"  >&lt;h1&gt;&lt;a name=&quot;Design&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;Design&lt;/h1&gt;

&lt;p&gt;The response body payload is transformed from a list of strings to an object, where&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;`search_count` is the total number of matches for front-end display,&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;`total_model_count` is the total number of unfiltered models without limit for front-end display,&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;`engines` is the list of engines, and `models` is the list of models. `engines` is the list of engines and `models` is the list of models.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;



&lt;p&gt;Example:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;before modification: `{&quot;code&quot;: &quot;000&quot;, &quot;data&quot;:&lt;span class=&quot;error&quot;&gt;&amp;#91;&amp;quot;HIVE&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;model1&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;model2&amp;quot;&amp;#93;&lt;/span&gt;, &quot;msg&quot;:&quot;&quot;}`&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;after modification: `{&quot;code&quot;: &quot;000&quot;, &quot;data&quot;:
{&quot;search_count&quot;:10, &quot;total_model_count&quot;:20, &quot;engines&quot;:[], &quot;models&quot;:[&quot;MODEL1&quot;, &quot;MODEL2&quot;]}
&lt;p&gt;, &quot;msg&quot;:&quot;&quot;}`&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
</comment>
